| **NIST AI 600-1** (GenAI Profile) | US (voluntary) | MS-2.3 through MS-2.11; MG-4.1 |
| **EU AI Act** (Reg. 2024/1689) | EU (binding Aug 2026) | Art. 9, 10, 13, 14, 15 |
| **BCBS 239** | International (Basel) | Principles 1, 3, 5 (risk data aggregation & reporting) |
| **BCB Res. 4.893** | Brazil | Art. 5, 7; Circ. 3.978 Art. 3 |
| **ISO/IEC 42001:2023** | International (certifiable) | Clauses 6.1.2, 8.2, 8.4, 9.1; Annex A.5.4–A.7.3 |

